abstract: >
  Public conceptual materials for the FROOM deterministic paradigm, including
  architecture descriptions, operator-based modeling concepts, structured
  paradigm documentation, and explanatory materials. This repository contains
  only public-facing conceptual content without proprietary implementation
  details.

